                         Patch Metadata - Gen 2/80 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                          
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ shared_ring_mixer                                                                         │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the highly overparameterized per-wire rotations with parity-shared parameters,    │
│                          │ reducing the ansatz from 24 distinct parameters to 5 while retaining limited spatial      │
│                          │ flexibility. Close the CZ chain into a ring to remove endpoint bias, then replace the     │
│                          │ post-entanglement RZ layer—which commutes with CZ and provides weak basis mixing—with     │
│                          │ shared RY rotations that convert learned phase correlations into observable population    │
