│ patch_description        │ Replace the fixed long-range CZ links with CRZ gates sharing one parameter. This          │
│                          │ preserves the useful antipodal connectivity while allowing training to regulate its       │
│                          │ strength, potentially suppressing over-entanglement and reducing the large generalization │
│                          │ gap. Sharing a single parameter across all four links maintains strong symmetry-based     │
│                          │ regularization and adds only one distinct parameter.                                      │
