│                          │ heterogeneous feature responses, while the three disjoint butterfly stages propagate      │
│                          │ information across all eight qubits in logarithmic depth. A tied post-mixer converts the  │
│                          │ aggregated correlations into measurable population differences. The single distinct       │
│                          │ parameter strongly regularizes the model, reduces overfitting risk, and improves          │
│                          │ parameter efficiency and convergence.                                                     │
