│                          │ local rotations and every hypercube entangler. Replacing fixed CZ and separate CRZ        │
│                          │ interactions with shared CRX gates allows the optimizer to continuously tune global       │
│                          │ correlation strength without increasing parameter count. Removing the redundant RZ layer  │
│                          │ reduces depth and overfitting, while edge-coloring the ring into disjoint brickwork       │
